{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "google-docs-import",
  "platform": "google-docs",
  "name": "Google Docs",
  "title": "Google Docs Markdown 导入",
  "navLabel": "Google Docs 导入",
  "description": "批量导入本地 Markdown，并尽量保留图片、公式和代码样式。",
  "type": "automation",
  "group": "import",
  "trustLevel": "community",
  "status": "experimental",
  "guide": "README.md",
  "homepage": "https://docs.google.com/",
  "tags": ["导入", "Markdown", "DOCX", "图片", "公式", "代码块", "OAuth"],
  "capabilities": {
    "export": false,
    "import": true,
    "guide": true,
    "login": true,
    "scanToc": false,
    "images": true,
    "attachments": false,
    "tree": false,
    "batch": true,
    "retryFailures": false
  },
  "fields": [
    {
      "name": "quick_start",
      "label": "快速开始",
      "type": "notice",
      "markdown": "### 首次授权一次，之后一步导入\n\n- **首次使用：** 选择 OAuth JSON，点击“授权 Google Docs”。若应用仍为测试状态，Chrome 中登录的账号必须已加入该 Cloud 项目的测试用户。\n- **以后导入：** 只需选择 Markdown 根目录，点击“开始导入”；不必重复选择 JSON 或授权。\n\n首次使用请先按下方教程启用 Drive API、添加测试用户，并创建“桌面应用”OAuth 客户端。Pandoc 会自动下载并校验，无需用户安装；预览和单篇测试均为可选操作。"
    },
    {
      "name": "oauth_client",
      "label": "Google OAuth 桌面客户端 JSON",
      "type": "file",
      "arg": "--oauth-client",
      "required": true,
      "history": "path",
      "placeholder": "不会上传；授权令牌保存在插件私有目录",
      "actions": ["login"]
    },
    {
      "name": "source_dir",
      "label": "Markdown 根目录（自动扫描子目录）",
      "type": "directory",
      "arg": "--source-dir",
      "required": true,
      "history": "path",
      "actions": ["plan", "importOne", "import"]
    },
    {
      "name": "source_file",
      "label": "单篇测试文件（可选）",
      "type": "file",
      "arg": "--source-file",
      "history": "path",
      "advanced": true,
      "actions": ["importOne"]
    },
    {
      "name": "max_import",
      "label": "最多导入数量（0 为全部）",
      "type": "number",
      "arg": "--max-import",
      "default": 0,
      "min": 0,
      "advanced": true,
      "actions": ["import"]
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "id": "login",
      "kind": "login",
      "label": "授权 Google Docs",
      "script": "../../backend/import_google_docs.py",
      "args": ["--login"],
      "includeSelection": false,
      "track": false,
      "secondary": true
    },
    {
      "id": "plan",
      "kind": "plan",
      "label": "预览文件数量（可选）",
      "script": "../../backend/import_google_docs.py",
      "args": ["--scan-source"],
      "includeSelection": false,
      "track": false,
      "secondary": true
    },
    {
      "id": "importOne",
      "kind": "import",
      "label": "先测试一篇（可选）",
      "script": "../../backend/import_google_docs.py",
      "args": ["--import-one", "--yes"],
      "confirm": "将在 Google Drive 真实创建一份测试文档，且不会自动删除。确认继续？",
      "secondary": true
    },
    {
      "id": "import",
      "kind": "import",
      "label": "开始导入",
      "script": "../../backend/import_google_docs.py",
      "args": ["--import-all", "--yes", "--progress-every", "1"],
      "confirm": "将在 Google Drive 批量创建文档；同一源文件的相同结果会自动跳过。确认继续？",
      "progressTitle": "Google Docs Markdown 导入",
      "progressDetail": "正在将 Markdown 转换为 DOCX 并创建 Google 文档..."
    }
  ]
}
